    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A gripping Roguelite that blends heart-pounding action with innovative echolocation mechanics. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play the role of the kings assassin whose eyes have been stolen by a demon. Now blinded, armed with nothing but your skills and cold-blooded rage, you rush towards the King to warn him of the danger in his castle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2963650/extras/aae1bc8ef8e3d751aa15d0e27891e861.poster.avif?t=1751974720\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2963650/extras/aae1bc8ef8e3d751aa15d0e27891e861.webm?t=1751974720\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2963650/extras/aae1bc8ef8e3d751aa15d0e27891e861.mp4?t=1751974720\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2963650/extras/47265f17c5e246ebe68cc2254e602c4d.avif?t=1751974720\" width=613 height=134 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >  </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Emit pulses of sound to reveal the environment around you, uncover hidden traps, and detect the presence of lurking adversaries through their unique sounds. Upgrade your senses as you play to unlock new abilities and master weapon techniques to help you in battle!  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2963650/extras/b319c88ada45b2df50107cf8cfe85823.poster.avif?t=1751974720\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2963650/extras/b319c88ada45b2df50107cf8cfe85823.webm?t=1751974720\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2963650/extras/b319c88ada45b2df50107cf8cfe85823.mp4?t=1751974720\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2963650/extras/7aa154d28b0f21a0847084d07c545d8e.avif?t=1751974720\" width=613 height=134 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interact with the residents of the castle who wish to help you on your mission, make pacts with demons who offer supernatural abilities and power! Pick your allies and pave the way for your own ending. The story is just as dynamic as the gameplay and your choices will affect both the world and the characters at the end off your journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2963650/extras/65fafd2fb34db1117947565cb5988096.poster.avif?t=1751974720\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2963650/extras/65fafd2fb34db1117947565cb5988096.webm?t=1751974720\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2963650/extras/65fafd2fb34db1117947565cb5988096.mp4?t=1751974720\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A gripping Roguelite that blends heart-pounding action with innovative echolocation mechanics. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play the role of the kings assassin whose eyes have been stolen by a demon. Now blinded, armed with nothing but your skills and cold-blooded rage, you rush towards the King to warn him of the danger in his castle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2963650/extras/aae1bc8ef8e3d751aa15d0e27891e861.poster.avif?t=1751974720\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2963650/extras/aae1bc8ef8e3d751aa15d0e27891e861.webm?t=1751974720\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2963650/extras/aae1bc8ef8e3d751aa15d0e27891e861.mp4?t=1751974720\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2963650/extras/47265f17c5e246ebe68cc2254e602c4d.avif?t=1751974720\" width=613 height=134 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >  </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Emit pulses of sound to reveal the environment around you, uncover hidden traps, and detect the presence of lurking adversaries through their unique sounds. Upgrade your senses as you play to unlock new abilities and master weapon techniques to help you in battle!  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2963650/extras/b319c88ada45b2df50107cf8cfe85823.poster.avif?t=1751974720\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2963650/extras/b319c88ada45b2df50107cf8cfe85823.webm?t=1751974720\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2963650/extras/b319c88ada45b2df50107cf8cfe85823.mp4?t=1751974720\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2963650/extras/7aa154d28b0f21a0847084d07c545d8e.avif?t=1751974720\" width=613 height=134 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interact with the residents of the castle who wish to help you on your mission, make pacts with demons who offer supernatural abilities and power! Pick your allies and pave the way for your own ending. The story is just as dynamic as the gameplay and your choices will affect both the world and the characters at the end off your journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2963650/extras/65fafd2fb34db1117947565cb5988096.poster.avif?t=1751974720\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2963650/extras/65fafd2fb34db1117947565cb5988096.webm?t=1751974720\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2963650/extras/65fafd2fb34db1117947565cb5988096.mp4?t=1751974720\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2>",
    "short_description": "A Roguelite RPG about betrayal, revenge, and how much you\u2019re willing to pay to get it. Use echolocation to fight your enemies, make pacts with demons to grow stronger, gather weapons, find the one who stole your eyes and make them pay!",
